>
  <p>Whitby offers a concrete crew real variety. The downtown heritage streets have century homes where the porch, steps and foundation coating all need a careful hand. The newer communities up through Brooklin and the north end have builder-grade flatwork hitting its first repair cycle. <a href="/">Concrete Toronto</a> works across all of it, and we back each job with a 2-year warranty.</p>

  <p>Older Whitby homes deserve respect. We match existing finishes where concrete meets the original house, protect mature landscaping during excavation, and keep the site tidy on streets where the neighbours are close. Newer homes get the same discipline, focused on the base prep that builder pours often skip.</p>

  <h2>Concrete work in Whitby: what we do</h2>
  <p>Most of our Whitby calls fall into a few buckets:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-driveways/">Concrete driveways</a>, replacements and new pours</li>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-patios/">Backyard patios</a> and <a href="/services/concrete-walkways/">walkways</a></li>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-porches/">Porches</a> and <a href="/services/concrete-steps/">steps</a>, repaired or rebuilt</li>
    <li><a href="/services/parging/">Parging</a> for foundation walls, with waterproofing where water is the real problem</li>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-repair/">Repair</a>, <a href="/services/concrete-replacement/">replacement</a> and <a href="/services/concrete-slabs/">slabs</a> for sheds and garages</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Bundle the flatwork, save the hassle</h2>
  <p>Driveway and patio in the same season? One visit gets you one quote, one schedule, one cleanup and a consistent finish across the property. We will price the bundle honestly, and if part of the work only needs a repair, we say so.</p>

  <h2>Why Whitby homeowners choose us</h2>
  <p>15 years of local experience and hundreds of concrete jobs across Toronto and the surrounding areas. Straight answers, a written quote with no pressure, and a crew that sticks to the schedule.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>2-year warranty on every job</li>
    <li>Satisfaction guaranteed</li>
    <li>Free, no-obligation quotes</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Getting started is simple. Send a few photos and a short description through the form, and we follow the same clear <a href="/#process">six-step process</a> on every job. We also work next door in <a href="/locations/oshawa/">Oshawa</a> and <a href="/locations/ajax/">Ajax</a>, so one call covers family or rental properties nearby.</p>
